sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant Main as app/main.py
    participant Camera as app/camera.py
    participant Detector as app/detector.py
    participant Analytics as app/analytics.py
    participant Renderer as app/renderer.py

    User->>Main: python -m app
    Main->>Detector: load()
    Detector-->>Main: model ready
    Main->>Camera: open()
    Camera-->>Main: camera ready

    loop Every frame, until Q or ESC
        Main->>Camera: read()
        Camera-->>Main: frame
        Main->>Detector: detect(frame)
        Detector-->>Main: list of Detection
        Main->>Analytics: update(detections, fps)
        Analytics-->>Main: FPS and class counts
        Main->>Renderer: draw_detections, draw_stats, draw_help
        Renderer-->>Main: annotated frame
        Main->>User: show the frame in the OpenCV window
        User-->>Main: key press
    end

    Main->>Camera: release()
    Main->>User: print the session summary
